+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""M4/G965F EC-only keybox adapter; no key material is read or generated.
+
+Reason: the fork requires RSA+EC even when a complete EC chain is provided.
+Files: staged SecSettings KeyboxUtils and staged framework provider/hooks.
+Verification: root pin remains in Settings; RSA requests without an RSA key
